        <mxCell id="note" value="The folder file is the source. Opening index.html loads that file into the tab. The HTML page, the JavaScript, and the in-memory note list then all live inside the browser.&#xa;&#xa;Notes you add stay in the notes array for this tab only. They are not written back to index.html. Reload discards the array, so the list is empty again.&#xa;&#xa;This app has no API gateway, backend, database, login, or network request." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e7;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=10;fontSize=14;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#1f2933;" vertex="1" parent="1">
